# Wan 2.2 · Fal · Nano Banana

Lecture upload is **Nano Banana still + Fal Wan Replace + ffmpeg mux original audio**. Query `presentProviderFeatures()` or API `providers` instead of re-researching.

## Wired on upload

- Still: `gemini-2.5-flash-image` (`GEMINI_API_KEY`), generateContent `TEXT`+`IMAGE`. Skip if a stable public https still exists. Do not persist expiring signed URLs.
- Replace: Fal `fal-ai/wan/v2.2-14b/animate/replace` (`FAL_KEY`). Required `video_url` + `image_url`. Chunk ~20s (min 2s, max 28s).
- Fallback replace only: DashScope `wan2.2-animate-mix` when Fal is missing.
- Always mux the original lecture soundtrack. Wan/Fal output is not trusted for audio.

## Reserved — never auto-run

`fal_wan_move`, `fal_wan_speech_to_video`, `fal_wan_image_to_video`, Gemini 3 Nano Banana 2/Pro (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image`, `gemini-3.1-flash-image`, `gemini-3-pro-image`), still-edit, video-to-image, Search grounding.

These invent motion, drop the filmed scene, or change the still model. Call them only with an explicit product request.

## Fail honestly

Missing keys → Vietnamese `WAN_MISSING_KEY` / `NANO_BANANA_MISSING_KEY`. No Ken Burns nameplate, toon filter, or HeyGen/Hailuo/D-ID as a working fallback.

